<title>FRANCE: French oil refining investments - table.</title>
<headline>French oil refining investments - table.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French industry ministry issued the following estimates for French refining investments between 1992 and 1999. Figures for 1992-1995 are based on actual spending. Figures for 1996 are based on company budgets. Figures for 1997-1999 are based on peliminary investment plans.</p>
<p>(Millions of francs, unadjusted for inflation. Figures are rounded to the nearest whole number, so columns may not add up).</p>
<p>		    1992  1993  1994  1995  1996  1997  1998  1999</p>
<p>		    ----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  TOTAL	   2943  2931  3021  2333  2170  1853  1426  1118</p>
<p>    Octane	1021   757   382   189   223    74    34    10</p>
<p>Dusulphur-</p>
<p>	isation    128   237   372   498   417   171    97    83</p>
<p>    Conversion   321   452   422   160   272   237    82    47</p>
<p>    Lubes	  114   230   381   185   256   201   106    64</p>
<p>    Bitumen	 37    49    51     6     2     2    10     0</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
